{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0274_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3baa637c9543e63f6f7b73c055d5aa2f2ccf2de59a4e6d3182cfc66b2679b0f2", "ja": "杏奈、お疲れさま。\n新しい衣装、どんな感じだ？", "zh": "杏奈，辛苦了。\n新衣服感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
